      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HOLLY ROSE (8) failed to feature last start at this track, but prior to that won by a long neck at Warragul (23.31) beating Rumour I'm Broke in a Grade 5 on July 28. Form from her last run is proving strong. Rates on top in this line up. AUDACIOUS PADDY (3) chased the lead early from the inside and boxed on well to finish third, beaten 2.25 lengths (24.58) at this track in a Grade 5 over 435m. Form from his last run is proving to be solid. Will give a great sight again. JUMBUK WANG WANG (5) was popular in betting last start but disappointed when 4.5 lengths away in fourth (24.81). Finished second the start before. The form from his last run stacks up well. Can figure in the finish. OUR MISS MAGGIE (1) will have admirers again after placing at this track and distance last time out.",
